      "value": "Are you using the matcap in Additive or Multiplicative mode? The latter may be what you want. Also note the warning in the shader inspector that using a matcap with a light ramp other than \"Flat\" may not give you the result you want.\n\nIf you still think there is a big here, please include an avatar and world ID that show the issue you describe. Thanks!",
